<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cristaleria 1Q net profit 14 pct higher.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cristaleria 1Q net profit 14 pct higher.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cristaleria group, the Spanish unit of the French glass maker Saint Gobain, posted first quarter net profit of 3.42 billion pesetas, up 14 percent versus 3.01 billion pesetas in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Sales totalled 35.70 billion pesetas, 2.2 pct down on 36.52 billon in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
